{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1320501-ronin-question","id":1320501,"title":"Ronin Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-24T08:38:39-07:00","id":1320501,"title":"Ronin Question","content":"I was looking, but I couldn't find an answer one way or another, but can a Ronin develop a personal totem? I know they are shunned even in the spiritual world, but it does mention in W20 that Wyld, and Triatic spirits are more likely to deal with a Ronin than others, in particular spirits of solitary animals. So I was trying to figure out if it'd be possible for a Ronin to get a personal totem of some of the Totems that are normally shunned by werewolves, such as Bear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3224-killebrew","name":"Killebrew","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-24T08:53:38-07:00","id":1320505,"title":"","content":"I can't think of a reason why not.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-24T09:58:38-07:00","id":1320517,"title":"","content":"I can see some totems feeling pity for the Ronin. I would have them still need to earn the trust of the totem, like Bear is only dishonorable 